發光的不明飛行物在沙漠上空盤旋約15分鐘後消失無蹤。（X@shanghaidaily）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250514/999266648764977152834165.jpeg/wbcl14eH0xNwgAGSVme9xvR3lDyoPpkyEtl9dhLZfXY\"/><figcaption>美國加州近日發生不明飛行物目擊事件。有居民拍攝到一段影片，顯示一個發光的不明飛行物在沙漠上空盤旋約15分鐘後消失無蹤。（X@shanghaidaily）</figcaption></figure><p>美國公布新UFO檔案！驚見地下儲藏庫計畫 擬存放特殊材料與生物樣本</p><p>五角大廈公布第六批UFO檔案！祕密研究曲速、蟲洞與輻射傷害</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:43:43.595511+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1955,"images":17,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:30:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:57:16.924563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T08:37:02.663863+00:00","content_hash":"e4c4e1fe95c037cc5d0f24622656f7bc1e25d097c5e177691b9b8c7a6d912b89","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}